{
  "ALL_TEXT": "38 EXT. KENNEL - DAY\nTwo men, the KENNEL OWNER and the KENNEL ASSISTANT, are\nsitting across each other on easy chairs, reading the\nnewspaper.\nKENNEL OWNER\nJob poyindi ani pelli cancel\nchesina ammaayi...Moosi nadi lo\ntheleeni abbaayi\nKENNEL ASSISTANT\nAnthe mari...office lo denno goki\nuntaadu...aina kottaga drugs anta\nbaava...software vaallu andaaru\nmukku podum laaga vaadestunnaaranta\nKENNEL OWNER\nDrugs ante gurthuku vochindi\nemadhya drugs ni kukkala kadupulo\nkudaa petti surfara chesthunnaaru\nanta...\nKENNEL ASSISTANT\n(resigned)\nKali kalam\nVEDA enters the kennel with the PUG in the baby sling.\nKENNEL OWNER\nHello, sir randi.\nVEDA\nBaavundandhi. Anni kukkalu\nbaagunnayi.\nKENNEL OWNER\nThank you sir.\nVEDA points at a bulldog, tongue sticking out and drooling.\nVEDA\nAdhigo, akkada, entha beautiful ga\nundho...\nKENNEL OWNER\nVaccination aa?\nVEDA\nEvariki?\nKENNEL OWNER\nMee kukka ki?\nVEDA\nAkkareledhu\nKENNEL OWNER\nMari unko kukka ni konaddaaniki\nochaara?\nVEDA\nKadhu ammadaaniki vachanu\nKENNEL OWNER\nEvariki?\nMeekey\nAhh..\nVEDA\nKENNEL OWNER\nVEDA\nadhi kadhu boss, maa vedhavokadu\ndheenni naaku antagattaadu. Nanu\nposhinchukovadame kashtamuga\nundhi..dheenni ekkada poshisthanu\nHe points at another pug\nVEDA\nsir ! adhi dheeni thalli laaga\nundhi...thalli biddalni veru\ncheyakudadhu sir.\nKENNEL OWNER\nnijameenandi, thallini kuda meere\nkonukkondi.\nThe PUG barks\nVEDA\nNuvvu normuye....dheenni em cheyalo\ntheliyaka chasthunna, chethulo\ndabbulu levu\nKENNEL OWNER\nSoftware aa?\nVEDA\nMeeku ela thelusu?\nKENNEL OWNER\nMoham choosthey\ntheliyattlaa...ikkado udhyogam\nundhi chesthara?\nVEDA\nenti ikkada?\nKENNEL OWNER\nDignity of labour undaali...ye\npanaina pane\nVEDA\nSarey.. Em cheyali\nKENNEL OWNER\n(smiles wickedly)\nOk, nenu mee kukka ne konaalenu\nkaani oka help cheyagalanu...meedi\nmale aa female aa...\nVEDA\n...Male...\nKENNEL OWNER\nSare...naa daggara six female dogs\nunnaayi...so veetiki three times\nmee kukkani anduku\nteskovaste...meeku trip ki 1,500\nista...\nVEDA\nWhat.?\nKENNEL OWNER\nAdhe mating ki\nVEDA\n(disgusted)\nMeeru dhenitho mating ah!!! Tch!!\nKENNEL OWNER\nBah..Na ada sunakaliki.\nVEDA thinks for a second; a realization dawns on him.\nVEDA\nantey basicga me sunakaliki pimp\navamantunaavu?\n(MORE)\nVEDA (CONT'D)\nNaa gurinchi emanukuntunnavu\nnuvvu...simham aakalitho\nchasthundhi kaani gaddi thinadhu...\nHe turns around and starts walking.\nVEDA\n(To the PUG)\npadhara, manchi break fast chesi\ntharuvatha em cheyalo alochidham.\nHe puts his hand in his pocket to check how much money he\nhas. Realizing he has nothing, he goes to the KENNEL OWNER.\nKENNEL OWNER\nenti simham gaddi thinadaniki\nvachhindha !\nVEDA\nAakalitho chachhekante vegetarian\nga bathakadam better kadha.\nVEDA talks to the pug\nVEDA\nRaa..manchi party chesukoni,\nrepudnunchi nee Laingika\nkaryakramam lo undhuvgaani\nThe PUG barks\nVEDA\nabbo .. laingikam antey neekkuda\nmood vachhidhe, mundhu neeko kukka\npaste, kukka brush, kukka soap\nkonaali.. padha\nCUT TO:",
